# Keeps deploy/supervisor/enabled/ alive in fresh clones even though
# every other file in this directory is gitignored. The runtime state
# of "which services are enabled" lives in this directory as symlinks
# pointing at ../available/*.conf; the Admin UI's Enable/Disable
# buttons add/remove those symlinks at runtime, and that state must
# NOT be steamrolled by git operations.
#
# See ../available/admin.conf top-of-file comment and run_all.sh's
# ``seed_enabled_symlinks`` for the seeding mechanism that populates
# the directory from ``config/default-enabled.txt`` on first start.
